Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:33.70,0:01:40.20,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,950)\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\blur0.6\fad(728,726)}Leader of the Mt. Atama Thieves,\NAshura Doji
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.70,0:01:40.20,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,950)\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(728,726)\t(686,728,\1a&H00&)\t(5774,5816,\1a&HFF&)}Leader of the Mt. Atama Thieves,\NAshura Doji
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oniwa Banshu are down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Mimawari Kuma are toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got no one left!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.22,0:01:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daikoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.92,0:01:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he had a reputation,\Nbut I wasn't expecting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't just resist the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used its power to wreck our troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:02:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see why the land of Juana has\Nremained untouched for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an island of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vos, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the only way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, Yadda-Bee?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Empty your mind and calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what'll happen\Nif I become an Oni.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please give me a second to compose myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.36,0:02:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is like a father to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm losing control, Sangoro! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't go alone, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall be with you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you help them, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raccoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no saving me anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now cut me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't do it, I won't\Nbe able to control myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have done our best, but this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr Raccoon, if we don't get that cure now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this whole floor, all of our friends\Nwill become ice! It's Oni again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us, Master Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of your men have\Nserved you faithfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to die from\Nyour virus alongside the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buzz off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I lift a finger for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You peons aren't worth saving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ever consider that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't have any use for you,\Nyou're no better than garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That virus is my masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it was created to\Nerase your deficiencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Pleasures?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already lost the Devil Fruit Lottery,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's not like you're gonna\Never amount to anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but giggling cannon fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha, ha, ha, cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for you waiters, no matter how long\Nyou wait, no more smile fruits are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lost your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd know better than the pleasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eternal waiters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A living tragedy, a colossal\Nmonument to failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way you scrubs can help the beast
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates is to become an\Noni and cause some chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before you kick the bucket! Ya dig?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better to burn out than fade away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is like\Nyou're telling us to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have more than enough troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave you a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That antibody could save\Na couple of you at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.66,0:05:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut down the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut down the oni.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every man for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.02,0:05:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.28,0:05:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of you might even survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's pirates for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you damned samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might want to think about\Nwhat you're protecting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, that raccoon made some big\Npromises, but he's a pirate just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think he can mass-produce\Nantibodies that quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tricked you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was infected as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably took the antibody\Nfor himself and got the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are nothing like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think pirates have morals?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may be farewell for now, but\NI'll follow you sooner or later, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hasty to follow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.82,0:07:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raccoon, don't try and stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're losing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was his choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand back and watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swallow it, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, did that fix him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working fine! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body's warming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're not dead, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're alive, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I knew you could\Ndo it, Mr. Raccoon Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuck! Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on it, Dr. Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, let me get attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.11,0:09:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, do the honors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Shuffer-Fade Snap-Do-Lyzer!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:08.82,0:09:10.74,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\blur1\bord3\shad0\b0\c&HF3EE9C&\fnDumpling-Regular\4c&HD5CC7E&\3c&HD5CC7E&\move(644.13,1980,644.13,1060,20,270)}C\NH\NO\NP\NP\NE\NR\NP\NH\NA\NG\NE
