Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.82,0:09:10.74,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\bord0\shad0\blur20\b0\c&H54EDF6&\fnDumpling-Regular\move(1320,1918,1320,1012,20,270)}N\NE\NB\NU\NL\NI\NZ\NE\NR
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inhale the mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think\Nyou're doing, you damn raccoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've destroyed my masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you even pull that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with the cure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's impossible to give\Nthe medicine to everyone on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the floor since you made sure\Nto infect so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:10:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I crafted a virus out of the\Nantibody, one that spreads just as fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can make a bad virus, I\Ncan beat it with a good virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to get creative and\Ndistribute it through mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all they need to do is breathe it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a doctor from\Na ratty little pirate crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you\Nlearn a trick like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because our crew has traveled the\Nworld and trained with the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, you got some nerve\Nhealing, my flunky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay in your lane, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their lives are mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm cleaning up your mess after you\Nlet a deadly virus get out of hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't a weapon you\Nshould use so lightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a genius, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I need a raccoon\Nto teach me ethics? Learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleasures!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way! If you want to die\Nso bad, then do it somewhere else!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.68,0:11:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our brothers were almost killed\Nby you, and for what? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raccoon here saved our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, what do we have to gain\Nfor working for a maniac like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.78,0:11:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we can die for someone worth\Nprotecting, ain't that right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mr. Raccoon! Mr. Raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Dr. Raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.92,0:11:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm forever in your debt, Mr. Raccoon! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raccoon, that was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hacks are lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one good raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.38,0:11:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:11:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can go to hell, queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I need you, chumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.16,0:12:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work back there, raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it, Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's one last thing I want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.16,0:12:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, Tanuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster point!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.25,0:12:53.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDFGKanTeiRyu-XB-CP\bord4\c&HA2CFE4&\blur0.8\fscx70\fscy70\3c&HA2CFE4&\fad(395,0)\1a&HFF&\t(353,395,\1a&H00&)\pos(1285,600)}Right-Brain Tower\N\NInside the Dome
Dialogue: 2,0:12:50.25,0:12:53.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDFGKanTeiRyu-XB-CP\bord0\c&H000000&\blur0.8\fscx70\fscy70\fad(395,0)\pos(1285,600)}Right-Brain Tower\N\NInside the Dome
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we climb through the ceiling, we can\Nhide in the space between the floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone will look for us in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:12:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going on a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be brave, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In truth, my heart is in turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yamato and I have dispatched\Nevery foe in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not because of our foes, but\Nbecause of my helplessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a useless burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all think far too highly of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am but a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.36,0:13:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am spineless and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not worth defending.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're perfectly great, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing great about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must give yourself time to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you may be small right now, but someday\NI know you'll grow into a fine shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be a great man someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can surpass even Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not true at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.59,0:14:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an eel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this happens when he's troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's unable to return to his human\Nform until his heart is at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you weren't born this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Momo, did you eat a Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.27,0:14:39.73,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDFGKanTeiRyu-XB-CP\bord3.5\c&HF4F3F4&\blur0.8\fscx75\fscy75\3c&HF4F3F4&\fad(772,0)\1a&HFF&\t(730,772,\1a&H00&)\pos(353,525)}Guest Parlor\N\NInside the Castle
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.27,0:14:39.73,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnDFGKanTeiRyu-XB-CP\bord0\c&H000000&\blur0.8\fscx75\fscy75\fad(772,0)\pos(353,525)}Guest Parlor\N\NInside the Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of Kaido,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when the Navy captured\Nhim all those years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.19,0:14:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk took the opportunity to\Nextract his bloodline elements,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:15:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then made an artificial\NDevil Fruit from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naturally, the world government\Nasked him to hand it over,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in the end, his creation was\Nviewed as a disappointing failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, they kept the fruit on Punk\NHazard instead of throwing it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you bringing that up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Punk Hazard was wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing more than a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it was destroyed in the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a team from Naval\NBase G5 reported that one
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,facility on the island\Nwas still in operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it was a failure, at least we know\Nthere won't be another Kaido out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who patched us up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's still a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I saw our benefactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:16:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no, I must have been dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare say it's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While we sit here, sir, Luffy and his\Nfriends are fighting Kaido on our behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we are injured, we must\Nreturn to the battle at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot relent until victory is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While we still have our lives to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.30,0:16:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My loyal retainers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've had a rough run of it, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How I've missed you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the years haven't been kind to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's Lord Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:17:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't blame you for being surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sent to the future\Nthanks to Toki's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall explain it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.78,0:17:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a tale!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lord Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's truly a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we'll have time to celebrate\Nour reunion once the battle is won!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We failed to slay Kaido\Nonce, but not this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could ask for nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us go forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Samurai, you're as loyal\Nas you were the day we parted!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, everyone stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be Lord Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ashura, my friend! Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did Lady Toki say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may lack the power needed\Nto return to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, we're able to leap ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The past cannot be\Naltered, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Toki was only able to\Nsend people to the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she couldn't have\Ndone that to Lord Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They both died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The history of that dark\Nday cannot be rewritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we can do is bury our\Nregret and fight for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so, and we'll do it beside our Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did your senses kill him on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ashura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What shameful behavior from a man who\Npledged his undying loyalty to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.32,0:19:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What say you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you be my samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.20,0:19:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ashura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've shown your true\Ncolors, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all felt the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that Lord Odin had returned to\Nus, but this is a snake in his guise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a cruel trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if that's not Lord Odin,\Nthen who are we dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll pay for getting my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ashura, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:19:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His voice, the way he acted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:20:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just like our Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.68,0:20:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one man can mimic Lord Odin so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reveal yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurt because of my mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.56,0:20:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I failed to finish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro should be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a sharp sword becomes\Ndull when pointed at a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never apologize for your kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing but a drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then where's Kanjuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm manipulating the\Ndrawing from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it's rather exhausting,\Nespecially since I'm injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear that, Kiku! From my perspective,\Nyour blade was pretty sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in fact, i'm certain that this\Nbattle will be my final performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but i have an unrelenting\Nforce that pushes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me on my revenge towards the kozuki clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so i can't die just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i shall pierce the heart of the.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Clan, and I'll make certain\Nto do it with my own blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard a voice earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An announcement I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It said that Lord Momonosuke\Nwas with Haki no Ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.48,0:21:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, we might\Nbe able to reach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want to do is die in peace\Nand you take that away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.40,0:21:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll die here, unable to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.86,0:21:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your dear Lord Odin will join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think he'd want\Nto go out with a pan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.82,0:22:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll die together, like\Ngood friends should.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall not know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.18,0:22:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall restrain him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knuckles!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save our lord and stop control!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.98,0:22:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love and grief lie, I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You filthy rat! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.10,0:23:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I curse you all, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never defile the name\Nof Kozuki Oden ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.88,0:23:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a nut!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.68,0:24:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now the climax, when I\Nshall play the lead at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.66,0:24:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I embody the Kozuki, then\NI eliminate the Kozuki, and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.78,0:24:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An immaculate final act.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful play my life has\Nbeen with all its twists and turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.30,0:24:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.70,0:24:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine then, but we're in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.40,0:24:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the pain in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.46,0:24:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sought to protect their kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.02,0:24:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mere insects standing in my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.68,0:24:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else keep pushing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.02,0:24:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.44,0:24:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.88,0:24:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, King.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.16,0:25:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please do not tarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.34,0:25:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.48,0:25:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.80,0:25:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the king of the day thinks\Nhe can defeat me all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.62,0:25:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've both been injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.48,0:25:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the match-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.98,0:25:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.78,0:25:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't stay behind to settle a score.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.84,0:25:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, Karoo, have created enough\Nvictims, Jack. It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.18,0:25:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no moon to rely on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.84,0:25:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you have no poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems we both will have to make do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.88,0:26:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta put this fire out quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.28,0:26:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water's run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.34,0:26:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.56,0:26:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.06,0:26:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to relish making\Nyou traitors pay. I was sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.60,0:26:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your head came off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.02,0:26:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get back from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.60,0:26:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought you could betray me, Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a beheading can keep you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.08,0:26:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're not\Neager for a second run.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.48,0:26:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite rude of Kaido, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.90,0:27:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll burn this castle to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.26,0:27:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm done with it, Onigashima\Nwill be nothing but a ball of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.32,0:27:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escape up here, and no way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.04,0:27:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every last one of you will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the cost of betraying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.74,0:27:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, could you try to\Nchange back to normal, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.14,0:27:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You kind of stick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.00,0:27:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.00,0:27:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Lord Momonosuke. Be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.62,0:27:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.78,0:27:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite my shameful outburst, I have\Ngotten better at controlling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.70,0:27:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I first met Luffy and his associates,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.34,0:28:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would transform into a dragon every\Ntime I was surprised or became sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.62,0:28:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but ask, is\Nit like my father's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.28,0:28:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could turn into\Na monster like he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.98,0:28:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I'd be of some use to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.68,0:28:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy is still on the battlefield\Nfighting my father as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.58,0:28:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be fighting Kaido as Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.88,0:28:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's power seems to be waning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.54,0:28:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for some reason, he's in\Nvery high spirits. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.30,0:28:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.66,0:28:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell are we supposed\Nto beat these two? Huh? Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.84,0:28:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything we do bounces\Nright off of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.24,0:28:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Emperors of the Sea\Nare just built different.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.18,0:28:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're trying to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.72,0:28:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can at least pretend\Nwe've got a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.72,0:29:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.50,0:29:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our attacks have to be\Ndoing something to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.62,0:29:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're human, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.68,0:29:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did that earlier and it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.34,0:29:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think before you attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.82,0:29:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say they're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.58,0:29:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're nothing like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.26,0:29:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That much is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.82,0:29:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.06,0:29:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't think you can beat\Nthem Then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.02,0:29:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying we need\Nto come up with a good
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.92,0:29:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plan first We should pull\None of them away from here
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're talking Those two side-by-side\Nare quite the gruesome spectacle
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A literal vision of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.32,0:30:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think this is the first\Ntime I've been through hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you always have that glimmer in your\Neye even when the stakes are down
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.00,0:30:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're ready to die boy you first old man
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.36,0:30:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You

